@startuml 012_p1Inquire15minAirInterfaceKpisFromCacaAndSetInDsfpOutput
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
p1Inquire15minAirInterfaceKpisFromCacaAndSetInDsfpOutput
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "p1Inquire15minAirInterfaceKpisFromCacaAndSetInDsfpOutput" as setKpi #LightBlue
participant "DPMDP\n(internal memory)" as data
participant "CaCa://v1/compute-air-interface-capacity-kpis-for-list-of-air-interfaces" as caca

note over requestor
  Requestor can hand over either of the two:
  - <b>dataHandle</b>: [DPMDP] this points to the Dsfp.output
    target object directly in the DPMDP memory
  - <b>DsfpOutput.air-interface-list</b>: [externalUsage] relevant
    data in the same format as in Dsfp
end note

activate setKpi

== case 1: DMDMP ==

requestor -> setKpi: {dataHandle}

note over setKpi
<u>ReadInputFromMemory</u>
end note
setKpi -> data: {dataHandle}
data --> setKpi: {DsfpOutput/air-interface-list}

note over setKpi
<u>GetKpis</u>
  Send relevant data from DsfpOutput/air-interface-list to CaCa.
  CaCa will attempt to compute the capacity KPIs for every
  AirInterface from the list.
  (Where KPI computation failed, CaCa will return -1 as attribute value.)
end note
setKpi -> caca: {air-interface-data}
caca --> setKpi: {air-interface-data with computed KPIs}

note over setKpi
<u>UpdateDataInMemory</u>
  Write the KPI data directly to
  DsfpOutput in memory 
end note
setKpi -> data: {air-interface-data with computed KPIs}
setKpi --> requestor: 204


== case 2: external usage == 

requestor -> setKpi: {DsfpOutput/air-interface-list}

note over setKpi
  <u>GetKpis</u>
  Request computed KPIs from CaCa
end note
setKpi -> caca: {air-interface-data}
caca --> setKpi: {air-interface-data with computed KPIs}

note over setKpi
  <u>ReturnDataNonHandle</u>
    Return the data with computed KPIs
end note

setKpi --> requestor: 200, {air-interface-data with computed KPIs}


deactivate setKpi
